{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I should probably head back too, and see if the Aphid's still afloat with Sab experimenting with essences.\" Roy says, while tying his rope of mending through the longbows, in two batches, and having a mage hand carry one batch. \"I'll see if they could use these at the Voice. See ya later, Ed.\"\nRoy leaves the park and heads to Kingsbridge, thinking about that neat bag Ben Franklin had on him.","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:54:37.810000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867479701412118559","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
