{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Secel eventually surfaces, taking in a breath and whipping her head back to move her hair from her face… mostly. She then moves closer to the edge of the pond and relaxes.","created_at":"2021-07-21T22:03:48.827000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867527311029174302","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Hello there, enjoying the perks of Gill Day?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T22:06:30.987000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867527991176069161","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"“Apart from the land being possibly deadly now?” She nodded. “Very much. How about yourself?”","created_at":"2021-07-21T22:07:29.004000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867528234517659679","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"It's alright, though I don't think water in my ears is such a good thing\" They shake their head a bit trying to get the water out","created_at":"2021-07-21T22:11:12.263000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867529170933907478","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"The Tiefling lets out a giggle. “Only think I have to worry about is banging my horns on something or someone.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T22:12:45.818000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867529563331100722","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"That's why I'm thankful that my horns are smol, they hardly get stuck on things. Though I have gotten them stuck on some kelp while swimming before\" they smile remembering fondly \"I had to cut it off and when I got out of the water I gave my mates hell of a scare. my head was covered in kelp so I looked like a monster had got out deck\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T22:22:08.598000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867531923803078687","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"At that she starts laughing. “Imagine if I did that. People might think I am some sort of new deep sea Fiend or something.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T22:24:11.354000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867532438677618738","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
