{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"They stand up and try to make themselves look bigger. It is not very effective. \"You need to make them feel an aura of fear. Including scary growling!\" They do a growl trying to imitate a dinosaur... a baby one","created_at":"2021-07-21T22:31:54.912000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867534382981316639","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
