{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"... you can't be serious. You rode in her mouth and weren't eaten?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T22:55:14.118000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867540251677687828","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"“Yes, I’m serious.” Her tone turned more serious. “She also hates the Reds.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T22:56:16.187000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867540512012763136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Should'ave started there! That's the stuff! Those redcoats do not need any more supporters\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T22:58:08.916000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867540984833114112","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"“I mean, if you’re a T-Rex, and a bunch of Reds try to capture you, I doubt it’s hard to ally yourself with those who hate them.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:00:02.273000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867541460285915167","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
