{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"“I get it, size difference is intimidating. All you have to do is show her you’re a friend. Scratches are an excellent way, too.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:10:13.428000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867544023655907328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"scratches? it cannot be that easy... if she eats me, I will come back in spirit to personally haunt you\" they smile, but their leg betrays how nervous they are to give this a go.","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:26:34.131000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867548137022947349","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Now that I think about it, I do not think I ever caught your name. Some times running from one side to the next can be quiet hectic, so introductions are left behind. Hello, I'm Ed... Ed Harkness\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:28:56.652000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T23:29:06.986000Z","id":"867548734798823444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"“It is a pleasure to meet you, Ed Harkness. I am Secel, warrior cleric of Athena.” She gives a bow and smiles. “And trust me, she’s not going to eat you as long as you don’t side with the Reds.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:30:27.662000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867549116523347978","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Ed also does a bow except theirs is so exaggerated that their ears touch the floor","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:35:24.352000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867550360931139584","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"She let out a laugh. “So formal. A little odd to see. But, not bad odd.” She then sat back down. “So, what made you hate the Reds?”","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:37:41.604000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867550936607621190","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(wow straight to the point... me likey!)","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:38:34.777000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867551159631347743","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Well, that... is a long story. It starts with a young jackalope hiding in a pirate boat, spending some years there, until the Redcoats put a stop to it. They took our ship, jailed all of those in the ship and the others that got away like myself had to stay in hiding for a few weeks. Those people were family to me\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:41:44.605000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867551955826901003","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I... managed to find a few of those in hiding and helped them out, but we never recovered the ship or our Captain. May she rest in peace\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:42:43.906000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867552204553846805","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"“I.. i’m sorry.” She said, her mouth starting to feel a little dry. “I. I had no idea..”","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:43:45.889000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867552464529522758","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"It is... not a happy story to tell. But it is in the past for me, and sadly, I am not the only one that has lost because of the redcoats\" They have a smile on their face \"We still have a chance at changing things so that no one will need to be rid of family... of precious possessions... or of their lives\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:46:55.106000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867553258164060170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"“Well, we can also serve them a little from the pot. What they take from us, we take from them, and more.” She then bit down on her lip. “But.. my beloved doesn’t agree with my more… radical side.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T23:50:39.410000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867554198962307134","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
